# S9 — extractQuestionsWithEduAI (QM), census docs/PICT_CENSUS.md § S9.
# See tests/models/extract-questions-with-eduai.oracle.ts for the oracle spec.
#
# `extractQuestionsWithEduAI` (apps/extensions/question-maker/app/backend/src/services/aiService.js:292),
# reached via the exported `extractQuestionsFromText`. Each chunk gets one
# retry on an empty/failed extraction; if the retry ALSO comes up empty, the
# error propagates out of the loop and ABORTS the whole call — any earlier
# chunk's already-extracted questions are discarded, not returned partially.
# `DuplicateBetweenChunks` and `Chunk2Outcome` are pinned irrelevant when
# `ChunkCount` is "one" (no second chunk to interact with), and
# `DuplicateBetweenChunks` is pinned irrelevant whenever either chunk fails
# outright (there is no case where both chunks' output exists to compare).
ChunkCount:              one, two
Chunk1Outcome:           success, retry-succeeds, retry-fails
Chunk2Outcome:           success, retry-succeeds, retry-fails
DuplicateBetweenChunks:  yes, no
TopicsPresent:           yes, no

IF [ChunkCount] = "one" THEN [Chunk2Outcome] = "success";
IF [ChunkCount] = "one" THEN [DuplicateBetweenChunks] = "no";
IF [Chunk1Outcome] = "retry-fails" THEN [DuplicateBetweenChunks] = "no";
IF [Chunk2Outcome] = "retry-fails" THEN [DuplicateBetweenChunks] = "no";
